{"id":"n49699-1-7","stage":4,"title":"등지 · 等地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49699-1-7-1","ko":"한국의 가수들이 해외에서 인기가 대단해.","zh":"韩国的歌手在海外非常受欢迎。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한국의","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국：韩国；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"한국의","audio":"/audio/7347e8613548d64ec96f.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국의","audio":"/audio/7347e8613548d64ec96f.mp3"}},{"text":"가수들이","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수들이","audio":"/audio/4767a5661c70cea2fb41.mp3"}},{"text":"해외에서","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외에서","audio":"/audio/c04c19c082bbdb5cc008.mp3"}},{"text":"인기가","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인기가","audio":"/audio/2a8b53817ec38aa1eb97.mp3"}},{"text":"대단해.","meaning":"很出色，很杰出","explanation":"대단하다：很出色，很杰出；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"대단하다","audio":"/audio/a89a72f50dfdf2daf4dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46607","senseId":"3","lemma":"대단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대단해","audio":"/audio/5289ce59dbbfb7a98a8c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef9