":"인기가","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인기가","audio":"/audio/2a8b53817ec38aa1eb97.mp3"}},{"text":"많대.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많대","audio":"/audio/80228bd02c18568d090b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"“그리하여(那样)”的缩略。","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"60238","definition":"“그리하여(那样)”的缩略。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"56aef31d9ebf1888","term":"특히","zh":"特别，尤其，尤为","audio":"/audio/56aef31d9ebf1888daf3.mp3","entryId":"71300","definition":"与众不同地。","pronunciation":["트키"]},{"id":"4a8da35605a88c91","term":"등지","zh":"等地","audio":"/audio/4a8da35605a88c91d246.mp3","entryId":"49699","definition":"表示省略其他的一些地方。","pronunciation":["등ː지"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f85ce0b9923533954717.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.618,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49699","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["韩国的歌手在海外非常受欢迎。","是啊，据说在中国、日本等地尤其受欢迎。","刚才那个人看着多大？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["韩国的歌手在海外非常受欢迎。","是啊，据说在中国、日本等地尤其受欢迎。","刚才那个人看着多大？"],"answer":1}]}
